        "original_id": "0c1b8634-fffb-595b-aac6-4dac1c58dd60",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dr. Brewster M. Higley\n- Songs: Home on the Range\n- Film series: Rough Riders\n- Films: Rock River Renegades\n- Genres: Western\n\nFacts:\n- Dr. Brewster M. Higley wrote the lyrics to \"Home on the Range.\"\n- \"Home on the Range\" was used as the theme song of the Western film series \"Rough Riders.\"\n- \"Destry\" is a Western, so the film series that used \"Home on the Range\" was of the same genre as \"Destry.\"\n- The \"Rough Riders\" film series included the movie \"Rock River Renegades.\"",
